  "notes": "Faithful iOS dark-mode imitation using Apple system colors (systemGreen #30d158, orange #ff9f0a, yellow #ffd60a, red #ff453a, blue #0a84ff) on pure black with #1c1c1e grouped cards (14px radius). Content is a 640px phone-width column centred on desktop. Coloured rounded-square app-icon chips (green, orange, blue, cyan) lead each card. Floating pill tab bar with a raised green circular Start (play) button in the middle overlaps content. Today's workout row shows tiny front/back muscle-map figures with targeted muscles in green. Streak card uses fire emoji, snowflake 'freeze' tokens and a medal emoji callout. Interactions on live: tapping a day opens a bottom sheet to choose a workout for that day; challenges collapse to segmented mini progress bars; a 'Welcome back' toast appears on load (not in capture)."
